{"name": "F.E.A.S.T", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/a3e3323bd45c9a2ffe7fe79585cebd26.avif?t=1783957208\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>F.E.A.S.T</strong> is a farming factory automation game focusing on cooking. You are a new recruit in a secret organization tasked with a critical mission: feed the gods before they destroy the world with their hunger. Farm ingredients, run food factories, and prepare gourmet-level offerings tailored to each divine being\u2019s impossible appetite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"87\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/38e9518071943a91dbeb155eb4cb477f.avif?t=1783957208\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gods have a bottomless appetite. So, we must prepare enough ingredients to meet their demand. As a new recruit, you will grow crops, raise animals, and harvest them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9d9ae6e8e8b04009da26b13df7ef808a.poster.avif?t=1783957208\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9d9ae6e8e8b04009da26b13df7ef808a.webm?t=1783957208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9d9ae6e8e8b04009da26b13df7ef808a.mp4?t=1783957208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"87\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/7344c07b78e415d02e8f11c3d1b82c5f.avif?t=1783957208\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We must build factory pipelines that handle the heavy lifting for us. Be a good recruit and follow the recipes to create gourmet dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9b21c9d014781327ee2f8b61e9c9998a.poster.avif?t=1783957208\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9b21c9d014781327ee2f8b61e9c9998a.webm?t=1783957208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9b21c9d014781327ee2f8b61e9c9998a.mp4?t=1783957208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"87\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/9650c11352d4f67c6687bd29838abfcf.avif?t=1783957208\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be prepared to cook a wide variety of cuisines, some of the finest dishes a mere mortal has to offer.\u00a0Yum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/28579fef1d1962182c8e1418a532ba83.poster.avif?t=1783957208\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/28579fef1d1962182c8e1418a532ba83.webm?t=1783957208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/28579fef1d1962182c8e1418a532ba83.mp4?t=1783957208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"87\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/740daad8a97062c4fea0695a05ec3233.avif?t=1783957208\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once the food is ready, deliver it to the shrines as offerings to the gods. The food must be delicious or prepare to face the gods\u2019 judgment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/f8e0b4f0589a62134096d2932327702b.poster.avif?t=1783957208\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/f8e0b4f0589a62134096d2932327702b.webm?t=1783957208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/f8e0b4f0589a62134096d2932327702b.mp4?t=1783957208\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/extras/80cb2fb6ade9d8a9d610deabf646a9af.avif?t=1783957208\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are a small four-man team studio, driven by our love for automation games, fantasy, and culinary world. We created this game with passion. We hope you have a great time and feel hungry playing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To be a part of our journey, please join our discord channel and follow our social media.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">YouTube</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All links are on the right side of the page.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Congratulations! You've been hired by an elite organization that cooks for gods. Farm, automate, and cook gourmet meals to appease divine beings.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823480/745802012bc3d7ca53db5b21c96963a0e706100c/header.jpg?t=1783957208", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "Automation", "Farming Sim", "Time Management", "Sandbox", "Base Building"], "developers": "Before40", "publishers": "Before40", "release_date": "Jul 13, 2026", "price": "$8.99", "appid": "3823480", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "13 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Mn7j82pmVwU", "first_seen": 1783893600.0, "review_rank": 298}